sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as End User
  participant Browser as Web Browser (SPA)
  participant AuthServer as OAuth 2.0 Auth Server
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant ResourceAPI as Protected Resource API

  User->>Browser: Navigate to Login Page
  Browser->>AuthServer: GET /oauth/authorize?client_id=web&scope=openid
  AuthServer-->>Browser: 302 Redirect with Auth Code
  Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/auth/callback (code, state)
  Gateway->>AuthServer: POST /oauth/token (code, client_secret)
  AuthServer-->>Gateway: 200 OK (access_token, id_token, refresh_token)
  Gateway-->>Browser: Set-Cookie: session_jwt (HttpOnly, Secure)
  Browser->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/user/profile (Cookie: session_jwt)
  Gateway->>ResourceAPI: Forward Request (X-User-Id: 42)
  ResourceAPI-->>Gateway: 200 OK { id: 42, name: "Alice", role: "admin" }
  Gateway-->>Browser: JSON User Profile Response
